{
  "abstract": "The Securities and Exchange Commission (\"Commission\") proposes to rescind amendments to its rules under the Securities Act of 1933 (\"Securities Act\") and Securities Exchange Act of 1934 (\"Exchange Act\") that require registrants to provide certain climate- related information in their registration statements and annual reports.",
